@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BorderColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A67C00
title OpenData system context
actor Operator
rectangle "OpenData command-line application" as OpenData
cloud "Public data publishers" as Publishers
database "SQL Server\nOpenData database" as Database
folder "Configuration and override files" as Config
folder "Logs, work and archive files" as Files
Operator --> OpenData : commands and overrides
OpenData --> Publishers : HTTPS requests
OpenData --> Database : pooled JDBC transactions
OpenData --> Config : reads
OpenData --> Files : writes
@enduml
